# t2 — OMO mass-ulw / workflow semantics vs this repository's agent-teams
## Difference matrix and candidate options (read-only research dossier)

Task: t2. Deliverable pair: `gap.json` (machine-readable matrix) + this log (narrative + citations).
Baseline: current working tree; upstream `code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent` @ `dev`, queried read-only through
GitHub code search. The pinned local snapshot remains `VENDOR_LOCK.json` = commit `8c57e46`, v5.0.0-beta.20;
