## 4. Difference matrix (condensed)

| # | Dimension | Upstream (mass-ulw / workflow) | Local (agent-teams + mpd) | Gap | Severity |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| D1 | Activation | Keyword-gated; nothing exists by default | Default-on: auto-provisions "MPD Default" on the first step | **Opposite defaults** | high |
| D2 | Trigger mechanism | Uniform keyword table + hidden conditional pointer | No keyword/pointer component exists | Missing mechanism | medium |
| D3 | Execution surface | Eval cell + `tool.workflow` + `OMO_DAG_SDK_ROOT`, run_id/lifecycle | DSH `workflow` script (no run_id/lifecycle) + event-driven task list | Name collision, semantics mismatch | high |
| D4 | DAG model | One run per phase; node id/category/dependsOn; fan-out then fan-in | One persistent task list; task + dependencies[]; no run boundary | Partial | medium |
| D5 | Node contract | TASK/DELIVERABLE/SCOPE/VERIFY/STOP WHEN, advisory lint | Machine-checked contract for quality kinds; work tasks need only a subject | Asymmetric | low |
| D6 | Verification | Doctrine + verification wave (no gate) | Mechanical gate: verdict=pass, auto repair, delivery blockers, coverage matrix | Local ahead | low |
| D7 | Goal binding | Every run goal-bound (create_goal; PR #7175) | No team-goal binding; delivery computed from the graph alone | Missing link | medium |
| D8 | Routing doctrine | team vs dag, explicit, pre-work | Prompt sizing runs INSIDE an already-provisioned team (preset `:88-102`) | Ordering bug | high |
| D9 | Scale | 60+ node waves, difficulty ladder | 16 members max, one model tier family | Different scale class | medium |
| D10 | Recovery | per-run retry/amend/send, adaptive retries | per-task attempt_id, parked attempts, captain reassign, cold-requeue | Different granularity | low |
| D11 | Human plane | None (autonomous) | Staged plan + Web approval + edit + halt/resume + panel | Local advantage | info |
| D12 | Corpus | mass-ulw skill ships | mass-ulw absent; two dangling references | Missing doctrine | medium |

